---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="90-Day Traffic vs. Messaging Study" description="A 90-day deep-dive into whether your dental practice has a traffic problem, a messaging problem, or both — with a clear action plan at the end.">

  <!-- PAGE HERO -->
  <section class="bg-white py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center bg-brand-red/10 text-brand-red text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-6">90-Day Study</span>
        <h1 class="font-display text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold text-brand-dark leading-tight mb-6">
          90-Day Traffic vs.<br />
          <em class="font-display italic font-normal">Messaging Study</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-base leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-xl">
          You wouldn't prep crowns on a patient without a comprehensive exam and films. You shouldn't start a marketing campaign without similarly diagnosing the problem. This 90-day study tells you exactly what's broken — and how to fix it.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center bg-brand-red hover:bg-red-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm px-6 py-3 rounded-md transition-colors">
          Apply for a Study Slot →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT WE STUDY -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-brand-slate text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3 text-center">What We Examine</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-brand-dark text-center mb-12">Two Levers. One Practice. Diagnosed Together.</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-red-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-red" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-3">Traffic Analysis</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">We analyze your Google Analytics data, organic search visibility, and landing page performance to determine if your practice's website is reaching people in your area.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-red mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Google Ads campaign structure &amp; spend efficiency</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-red mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Keyword targeting and negative keyword gaps</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-red mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Geographic targeting and bid strategy accuracy</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-teal-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-teal" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 10h.01M12 10h.01M16 10h.01M9 16H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v8a2 2 0 01-2 2h-5l-3 3v-3z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-3">Messaging Analysis</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">We add HIPAA-Compliant call-tracking site to identify how your website is currently performing to drive new patient interactions, and where intent is potentially breaking down and trust is being lost before the call.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-teal mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Ad copy relevance and offer clarity</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-teal mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Landing page trust signals and call-to-action</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-teal mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Patient journey alignment from click to booked appointment</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section class="bg-white py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-brand-slate text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3 text-center">The Process</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-brand-dark text-center mb-12">How the 90-Day Study Works</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-red text-white font-display font-semibold text-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">1</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-2">You Share Access</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We ask for read-only access to your Google Ads account and website analytics. No changes made without your approval. Everything stays HIPAA-compliant.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-teal text-white font-display font-semibold text-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">2</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-2">We Study &amp; Test</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Dr. Wank personally reviews your traffic and messaging data over 90 days. No junior analysts. No templated reports. A real diagnosis from someone who knows dentistry.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-slate text-white font-display font-semibold text-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">3</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-2">You Get a Verdict</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We deliver a clear, prioritized action plan — whether you work with us or not. You'll know exactly what's broken and what to do first.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT YOU GET -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-brand-slate text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3 text-center">Deliverables</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-brand-dark text-center mb-12">What You Walk Away With</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        {[
          { title: "Traffic Diagnosis Report", desc: "A breakdown of where your ad spend is going and what it's returning — with specific recommendations." },
          { title: "Messaging Scorecard", desc: "A page-by-page review of your patient-facing copy rated against conversion best practices." },
          { title: "Priority Action Plan", desc: "A ranked list of fixes sorted by impact and effort — so you know exactly what to do first." },
          { title: "60-Minute Readout Call", desc: "A live walkthrough with Dr. Wank so you can ask questions and leave with full clarity." },
        ].map(item => (
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm flex gap-4">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-slate/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-slate" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-brand-dark text-sm mb-1">{item.title}</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">{item.desc}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-brand-slate py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <p class="text-white/60 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">Limited Availability</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">Ready to Find Out What's Holding You Back?</h2>
      <p class="text-white/70 text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">We only take on a handful of studies per quarter to protect quality. Apply now to secure your slot.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center bg-brand-red hover:bg-red-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm px-8 py-4 rounded-md transition-colors">
        Apply for a Study Slot →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
